<div id="payment-and-conditions" class="mt-6 mb-2" data-controller="terms-accept">
  <label class="flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer group">
    <input type="checkbox"
           id="terms_accept"
           data-terms-accept-target="checkbox"
           data-action="change->terms-accept#toggle"
           class="mt-0.5 cursor-pointer shrink-0 w-5 h-5 checkbox-input"
           aria-required="true">
    <span class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed select-none">
      I have read and agree to the
      <a href="/policies/terms-and-conditions" target="_blank" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>
      and
      <a href="/policies/privacy-policy" target="_blank" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
      By checking this box I confirm I am obligated to complete this purchase.
      For special orders and pre-ordered items, the right of withdrawal does not apply (EU Dir. 2011/83/EU, Art. 16c).
      <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
      <span class="block text-xs text-muted/70 mt-1">
        S potrditvijo tega polja potrjujem, da sem dolžan/a dokončati nakup in da za posebna naročila ter prednaročila pravica do odstopa od pogodbe ne velja.
      </span>
    </span>
  </label>
  <p data-terms-accept-target="error"
     class="hidden text-sm text-red-500 mt-1 ml-8">
    Please accept the Terms &amp; Conditions and Privacy Policy to continue. /
    Prosimo, sprejmite splošne pogoje za nadaljevanje.
  </p>
</div>

